Dialogue: 5,0:00:08.75,0:00:10.82,Default,T,0,0,0,,S-Sakamoto...
Dialogue: 5,0:00:11.73,0:00:12.99,Default,T,0,0,0,,Where...
Dialogue: 5,0:00:12.99,0:00:14.44,Default,T,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:15.25,0:00:16.84,Default,T,0,0,0,,Sakamoto...
Dialogue: 5,0:00:16.84,0:00:18.20,Default,T,0,0,0,,Sakamoto!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:20.24,0:00:22.52,Default,T,0,0,0,,Why do you always leave me?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:23.21,0:00:24.54,Italics,T,0,0,0,,{\an7\1c&H00AAAAFF&}I'm anxious.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:24.54,0:00:25.70,Default,T,0,0,0,,Did you abandon me?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:25.70,0:00:27.29,Italics,T,0,0,0,,{\an7\1c&H00AAAAFF&}I'm always being left alone.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:27.29,0:00:28.18,Italics,T,0,0,0,,{\an7\1c&H00AAAAFF&}I'm scared.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:28.18,0:00:29.84,Italics,T,0,0,0,,{\an9\1c&H00CCFFCC&}I'm hurt, so I'm left out?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:29.84,0:00:30.72,Default,T,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:30.72,0:00:32.50,Italics,T,0,0,0,,{\an9\1c&H00CCFFCC&}You're just going to ignore me?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:33.35,0:00:35.62,Italics,T,0,0,0,,{\an7\1c&H00AAAAFF&}Why won't you tell me anything?!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:35.62,0:00:37.22,Italics,T,0,0,0,,{\an9\1c&H00CCFFCC&}Why does this have to...
Dialogue: 5,0:00:37.22,0:00:38.08,Italics,T,0,0,0,,{\an7\1c&H00AAAAFF&}Like with the chips.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:38.08,0:00:39.46,Italics,T,0,0,0,,{\an9\1c&H00CCFFCC&}...happen to me?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:39.46,0:00:41.55,Italics,T,0,0,0,,{\an7\1c&H00AAAAFF&}I didn't mean to not tell you.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:41.55,0:00:43.74,Italics,T,0,0,0,,{\an7\1c&H00AAAAFF&}I was just doing my job.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:43.74,0:00:44.98,Italics,T,0,0,0,,{\an7\1c&H00AAAAFF&}You've got things you've...
Dialogue: 5,0:00:44.98,0:00:45.98,Italics,T,0,0,0,,{\an9\1c&H00CCFFCC&}Life's just a rat race.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:45.98,0:00:47.44,Italics,T,0,0,0,,{\an7\1c&H00AAAAFF&}...been keeping from me, don't you?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:47.44,0:00:49.40,Italics,T,0,0,0,,{\an9\1c&H00CCFFCC&}It's kill or be killed.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:49.40,0:00:51.52,Italics,T,0,0,0,,{\an7\1c&H00AAAAFF&}You have three chips, don't you?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:51.52,0:00:53.14,Italics,T,0,0,0,,{\an7\1c&H00AAAAFF&}No one would believe it...
Dialogue: 5,0:00:53.14,0:00:54.70,Italics,T,0,0,0,,{\an9\1c&H00CCFFCC&}That's all there is to it.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:55.90,0:00:57.92,Italics,T,0,0,0,,{\an7\1c&H00AAAAFF&}I should make these chips...
Dialogue: 5,0:00:57.92,0:00:59.18,Italics,T,0,0,0,,{\an9\1c&H00CCFFCC&}He's just using me.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:59.18,0:01:01.70,Italics,T,0,0,0,,{\an7\1c&H00AAAAFF&}...my trump card!
Dialogue: 5,0:01:00.43,0:01:01.70,Italics,T,0,0,0,,{\an9\1c&H00CCFFCC&}What are they doing here?
Dialogue: 5,0:01:02.53,0:01:03.64,Italics,T,0,0,0,,{\an7\1c&H00AAAAFF&}I want to go home.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:02.91,0:01:03.64,Italics,T,0,0,0,,{\an9\1c&H00CCFFCC&}No!
Dialogue: 5,0:01:03.64,0:01:04.59,Italics,T,0,0,0,,{\an7\1c&H00AAAAFF&}Let me go home.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:04.11,0:01:05.64,Italics,T,0,0,0,,{\an9\1c&H00CCFFCC&}If I don't, I'll die.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:05.64,0:01:06.48,Italics,T,0,0,0,,{\an7\1c&H00AAAAFF&}I miss them.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:06.48,0:01:07.54,Italics,T,0,0,0,,{\an9\1c&H00CCFFCC&}I don't want to die!
Dialogue: 5,0:01:07.54,0:01:08.46,Italics,T,0,0,0,,{\an7\1c&H00AAAAFF&}I miss them.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:08.46,0:01:09.79,Italics,T,0,0,0,,{\an9\1c&H00CCFFCC&}I don't want to die!
Dialogue: 5,0:01:09.79,0:01:11.33,Default,T,0,0,0,,I miss them!
Dialogue: 5,0:01:11.65,0:01:12.59,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Daddy.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:16.83,0:01:18.59,Default,T,0,0,0,,Wh-Who's there?
Dialogue: 5,0:01:23.57,0:01:24.68,Default,T,0,0,0,,Is someone...
Dialogue: 5,0:01:25.77,0:01:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Is someone there?
Dialogue: 5,0:01:28.27,0:01:30.92,Default,T,0,0,0,,Are you back, Sakamoto?
Dialogue: 5,0:01:32.83,0:01:33.84,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Daddy.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:41.51,0:01:42.87,Default,T,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 5,0:01:42.87,0:01:44.16,Default,T,0,0,0,,That almost sounded like...
Dialogue: 5,0:01:45.75,0:01:47.26,Default,T,0,0,0,,I've finally gone—
Dialogue: 5,0:01:47.26,0:01:48.04,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Daddy.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:53.75,0:01:56.32,Default,T,0,0,0,,Y-Yuzuhiko!
Dialogue: 5,0:01:57.00,0:01:58.76,Default,T,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?!
Dialogue: 5,0:01:58.76,0:02:00.82,Default,T,0,0,0,,When did you arrive on this island?
Dialogue: 5,0:02:00.82,0:02:02.20,Default,T,0,0,0,,I can't—
Dialogue: 5,0:02:05.25,0:02:09.12,Default,T,0,0,0,,I missed you so much.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:09.77,0:02:12.00,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Why haven't you come home yet?
Dialogue: 5,0:02:12.52,0:02:15.67,Default,T,0,0,0,,I-I couldn't...
Dialogue: 5,0:02:15.67,0:02:17.20,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,I miss you.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:17.20,0:02:18.92,Default,T,0,0,0,,I know...
Dialogue: 5,0:02:18.92,0:02:22.24,Default,T,0,0,0,,but I'm badly hurt.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:22.24,0:02:25.12,Default,T,0,0,0,,And I don't have enough chips yet.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:25.58,0:02:27.37,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,I miss you!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:27.37,0:02:29.65,Default,T,0,0,0,,I miss you, too.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:29.65,0:02:31.51,Default,T,0,0,0,,Of course I do!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:31.51,0:02:33.60,Default,T,0,0,0,,But the chips...
Dialogue: 5,0:02:33.60,0:02:36.90,Default,T,0,0,0,,I don't have eight chips.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:36.90,0:02:39.16,Default,Wife,0,0,0,,Sure you do.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:41.51,0:02:42.62,Default,T,0,0,0,,Akiko!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:42.62,0:02:46.72,Default,Wife,0,0,0,,Is your mind so far gone that you can't count?
Dialogue: 5,0:02:47.29,0:02:49.47,Default,T,0,0,0,,Count?
Dialogue: 5,0:02:50.37,0:02:53.73,Default,Wife,0,0,0,,How many chips do you have?
Dialogue: 5,0:02:53.73,0:02:56.36,Default,T,0,0,0,,H-How many chips...
Dialogue: 5,0:02:57.85,0:02:59.90,Default,T,0,0,0,,One, two...
Dialogue: 5,0:03:00.93,0:03:02.15,Default,T,0,0,0,,Three...
Dialogue: 5,0:03:02.15,0:03:04.49,Default,Wife,0,0,0,,That isn't enough, is it?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:05.95,0:03:08.74,Default,T,0,0,0,,No, I have more.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:09.09,0:03:13.04,Default,T,0,0,0,,Four, five, six...
Dialogue: 5,0:03:13.45,0:03:14.60,Default,T,0,0,0,,Seven...
Dialogue: 5,0:03:15.21,0:03:16.29,Default,T,0,0,0,,Eight!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:18.31,0:03:20.80,Default,T,0,0,0,,I-I can...
Dialogue: 5,0:03:20.80,0:03:22.56,Default,T,0,0,0,,I can go home!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:24.59,0:03:28.05,Default,T,0,0,0,,Just wait for me, Yuzuhiko, Akiko!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:28.59,0:03:30.97,Default,T,0,0,0,,Daddy's coming! He's coming home!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:31.71,0:03:34.70,Default,T,0,0,0,,And then we can all go get \Nsomething good to eat.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:34.70,0:03:38.98,Default,T,0,0,0,,Let's all go to Ajinoya and have all the okonomiyaki we can eat!
