Dialogue: 5,0:05:23.09,0:05:24.81,Default,H,0,0,0,,It's gotten foggy.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:24.81,0:05:27.05,Default,S,0,0,0,,The sun's starting to set, too.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:27.79,0:05:29.83,Default,S,0,0,0,,The lizards will be waking up soon.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:29.83,0:05:31.35,Default,S,0,0,0,,Let's hurry back.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:46.42,0:05:47.27,Default,H,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:47.27,0:05:47.87,Default,S,0,0,0,,Shh.{Ep.11 23:48}
Dialogue: 5,0:05:48.62,0:05:51.05,Default,S,0,0,0,,I hear something...{Ep.11 23:49}
Dialogue: 5,0:05:52.42,0:05:55.08,Default,H,0,0,0,,I-It isn't a lizard, is it?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:56.22,0:05:58.46,Default,S,0,0,0,,No, this sound...
Dialogue: 5,0:05:59.22,0:06:00.21,Default,S,0,0,0,,It can't be...
Dialogue: 5,0:06:01.74,0:06:03.26,Default,S,0,0,0,,A homing type?{Ep.11 23:56}
Dialogue: 5,0:06:03.26,0:06:03.92,Default,H,0,0,0,,Ryouta!{Ep.11 23:58}
Dialogue: 5,0:06:04.80,0:06:05.80,Default,S,0,0,0,,It's locked onto me!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:10.02,0:06:11.77,Default,H,0,0,0,,Ryouta, run!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:14.46,0:06:15.23,Italics,S,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:15.23,0:06:17.10,Italics,S,0,0,0,,If it gets within range, it'll detonate!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:30.60,0:06:32.34,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Homing type bombs...
Dialogue: 5,0:06:32.34,0:06:33.97,Italics,S,0,0,0,,The only person with this type of BIM...{Ep.11 23:59}
Dialogue: 5,0:06:35.50,0:06:36.46,Italics,S,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:36.46,0:06:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Taira!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:38.04,0:06:40.15,Default,S,0,0,0,,If you're the one doing this, stop!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:40.15,0:06:42.17,Default,S,0,0,0,,We're on the same side!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:42.17,0:06:43.71,Default,H,0,0,0,,Ryouta, behind you!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:49.50,0:06:50.03,Default,S,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:50.03,0:06:51.43,Default,S,0,0,0,,It's within range!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:52.60,0:06:54.10,Italics,T,0,0,0,,Got him!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:54.74,0:06:55.77,Default,H,0,0,0,,Ryouta!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:01.14,0:07:04.07,Default,S,0,0,0,,He got my leg.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:05.72,0:07:07.77,Default,H,0,0,0,,Th-This is really bad.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:08.92,0:07:11.74,Default,H,0,0,0,,Mr. Taira, please stop!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:12.14,0:07:14.37,Default,H,0,0,0,,Why are you doing something so awful?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:14.94,0:07:17.04,Default,H,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:17.04,0:07:18.55,Default,H,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 5,0:07:21.34,0:07:23.42,Italics,Murasaki,0,0,0,,When you get six chips,{Ep.8 20:23}
Dialogue: 5,0:07:24.14,0:07:27.42,Italics,Murasaki,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,929)}the two of you will be tested.{Ep.8 20:26}
Dialogue: 5,0:07:28.64,0:07:35.43,Italics,T,0,0,0,,Is Mr. Taira betraying us to get all the chips?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:43.48,0:07:44.71,Italics,S,0,0,0,,No response.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:45.48,0:07:46.63,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:46.63,0:07:49.78,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Where's that damned old man hiding?!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:56.06,0:07:57.35,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:57.35,0:07:59.28,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Why did he betray us?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:59.28,0:08:03.10,Italics,S,0,0,0,,We promised to get out of here together,
Dialogue: 5,0:08:03.10,0:08:05.34,Italics,S,0,0,0,,but still he... Why?!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:05.34,0:08:10.84,Italics,T,0,0,0,,I wondered if maybe you wouldn't come back,{Ep.6 5:01}
Dialogue: 5,0:08:10.84,0:08:12.75,Italics,T,0,0,0,,If you had abandoned me...{Ep.6 5:05}
Dialogue: 5,0:08:12.75,0:08:16.10,Italics,T,0,0,0,,It was all I could think about.{Ep.6 5:09}
Dialogue: 5,0:08:16.48,0:08:17.59,Italics,T,0,0,0,,No!{Ep.7 10:11}
Dialogue: 5,0:08:17.59,0:08:19.75,Italics,T,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no, no!{Ep.7 10:12}
Dialogue: 5,0:08:19.75,0:08:22.90,Italics,T,0,0,0,,This time, it's over.{Ep.7 10:14}
Dialogue: 5,0:08:22.90,0:08:25.31,Italics,T,0,0,0,,If you leave me here, I... I...{Ep.7 10:17}
Dialogue: 5,0:08:25.31,0:08:28.40,Italics,T,0,0,0,,won't be able to stay sane.{Ep.7 10:21}
Dialogue: 5,0:08:28.94,0:08:32.78,Italics,S,0,0,0,,We need clean towels and water for you.{Ep.7 10:02}
Dialogue: 5,0:08:32.78,0:08:34.95,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Don't worry.{Ep.9 6:08}
Dialogue: 5,0:08:34.95,0:08:37.20,Italics,S,0,0,0,,We'll come back with some delicious food.{Ep.9 6:11}
Dialogue: 5,0:08:37.20,0:08:38.89,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Is it my fault?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:39.50,0:08:41.69,Italics,S,0,0,0,,No matter what my reasons were,
Dialogue: 5,0:08:41.69,0:08:44.17,Italics,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who made him feel so anxious.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:45.32,0:08:47.42,Italics,S,0,0,0,,He was so terrified.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:47.42,0:08:50.30,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Why did I never take notice?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:50.30,0:08:52.89,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Was I...
Dialogue: 5,0:08:52.89,0:08:54.18,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Was I doing...
Dialogue: 5,0:08:54.96,0:08:57.39,Italics,,0,0,0,,the same thing my dad did?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:59.77,0:09:03.27,Italics,S,0,0,0,,My dad was obsessed with work and never spent any time with me.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:03.70,0:09:07.39,Italics,S,0,0,0,,And my mom divorced and remarried without giving one god damn for me.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:08.78,0:09:10.51,Italics,S,0,0,0,,"Adults are selfish.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:10.51,0:09:12.77,Italics,S,0,0,0,,They only think about themselves.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:13.28,0:09:16.83,Italics,S,0,0,0,,They're satisfied with pretending to care about me."
Dialogue: 5,0:09:16.83,0:09:18.63,Italics,S,0,0,0,,That was what I thought.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:19.66,0:09:25.79,Italics,S,0,0,0,,In spite of that, have I treated Mr. Taira exactly in the way I once was?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:26.30,0:09:29.65,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Was I pretending not to see how he felt?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:30.28,0:09:31.67,Default,O,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:32.68,0:09:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You were running away from reality.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:37.04,0:09:38.41,Default,H,0,0,0,,Ryouta...
Dialogue: 5,0:09:38.41,0:09:39.49,Default,H,0,0,0,,Ryouta!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:39.93,0:09:41.23,Default,H,0,0,0,,Snap out of it!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:41.23,0:09:43.15,Default,H,0,0,0,,I hear another BIM.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:43.15,0:09:44.49,Default,H,0,0,0,,Quickly!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:44.49,0:09:46.10,Default,H,0,0,0,,We need to get out of here.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:49.76,0:09:50.73,Default,H,0,0,0,,Ryouta!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:53.98,0:09:55.29,Default,S,0,0,0,,Run, Himiko!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:01.58,0:10:03.09,Default,S,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:03.09,0:10:04.33,Default,S,0,0,0,,Hurry and run!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:05.06,0:10:10.09,Italics,S,0,0,0,,If the game we're playing has the same rules as {\i0}BTOOOM!{\i1}...
Dialogue: 5,0:10:10.80,0:10:14.68,Italics,H,0,0,0,,then that homing type works just like it does in the game.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:15.16,0:10:17.43,Italics,H,0,0,0,,I know what I've got to do.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:18.30,0:10:20.01,Italics,H,0,0,0,,I know what I...
Dialogue: 5,0:10:21.52,0:10:22.14,Default,S,0,0,0,,Himiko!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:22.14,0:10:23.81,Italics,T,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:26.82,0:10:27.89,Italics,T,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:29.12,0:10:32.73,Italics,T,0,0,0,,It only explodes when it comes within range of its target.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:35.02,0:10:36.11,Italics,T,0,0,0,,I'll protect him.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:36.86,0:10:38.65,Italics,,0,0,0,,I'll protect Ryouta!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:39.95,0:10:42.24,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Th-This...
Dialogue: 5,0:10:42.24,0:10:43.29,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 5,0:10:51.56,0:10:52.83,Italics,S,0,0,0,,There's no doubt.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:53.46,0:10:54.67,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Himiko...
Dialogue: 5,0:10:55.16,0:10:58.41,Italics,S,0,0,0,,She's the same Himiko I met in{\i0} BTOOOM!{\i1}.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:17.76,0:11:19.63,Italics,H,0,0,0,,Mr. Taira isn't moving.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:20.70,0:11:24.83,Italics,H,0,0,0,,But he's out there, somewhere we can't see him.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:24.83,0:11:25.53,Default,S,0,0,0,,Himiko...
Dialogue: 5,0:11:26.16,0:11:27.25,Default,H,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:27.25,0:11:30.19,Default,H,0,0,0,,The homing types can only lock on to a single person.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:30.19,0:11:31.75,Default,H,0,0,0,,I'll take care of them.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:31.75,0:11:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,A-All right.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:35.70,0:11:37.03,Italics,T,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:37.96,0:11:40.25,Italics,T,0,0,0,,Sakamoto, Himiko...
Dialogue: 5,0:11:40.25,0:11:42.22,Italics,T,0,0,0,,Don't hate me for this.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:42.72,0:11:44.57,Italics,T,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 5,0:11:44.57,0:11:46.89,Italics,T,0,0,0,,It's a game, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:47.76,0:11:49.51,Italics,T,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:50.48,0:11:53.61,Italics,T,0,0,0,,Ain't that right, Yuzuhiko?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:53.61,0:11:54.71,Italics,T,0,0,0,,Akiko?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:56.34,0:11:57.11,Default,H,0,0,0,,It's coming!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:57.11,0:11:58.02,Default,S,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:59.02,0:11:59.99,Default,H,0,0,0,,I can hear it.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:01.50,0:12:02.28,Default,H,0,0,0,,Over there.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:06.72,0:12:08.45,Default,H,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter how many you send!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:09.66,0:12:11.75,Italics,S,0,0,0,,There's something wrong here.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:12.98,0:12:16.92,Italics,S,0,0,0,,If he really intended to kill me, \Nwould he waste his BIMs like this?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:17.50,0:12:20.07,Italics,S,0,0,0,,No, he wouldn't.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:20.62,0:12:21.91,Italics,S,0,0,0,,He's smarter than that.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:22.92,0:12:25.55,Italics,S,0,0,0,,That means that BIM is targeted at...
Dialogue: 5,0:12:26.38,0:12:27.68,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Mr. Taira's target is...
Dialogue: 5,0:12:28.80,0:12:30.56,Italics,S,0,0,0,,you, Himiko!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:38.65,0:12:39.71,Italics,S,0,0,0,,I did it.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:39.71,0:12:41.15,Italics,S,0,0,0,,I outsmarted him.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:41.15,0:12:43.23,Italics,T,0,0,0,,H-He outsmarted me!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:43.23,0:12:45.29,Italics,T,0,0,0,,D-Damn...
Dialogue: 5,0:12:45.29,0:12:46.15,Italics,T,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:47.96,0:12:49.09,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Mr. Taira...
Dialogue: 5,0:12:53.56,0:12:55.66,Default,T,0,0,0,,C-Crap.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:56.28,0:12:59.38,Default,S,0,0,0,,Mr. Taira! Mr. Taira!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:59.84,0:13:01.13,Default,T,0,0,0,,Oh no...
Dialogue: 5,0:13:01.13,0:13:02.57,Default,T,0,0,0,,He's going to kill me.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:03.76,0:13:05.13,Default,T,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:06.55,0:13:08.19,Default,S,0,0,0,,Mr. Taira!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:09.94,0:13:13.68,Default,S,0,0,0,,Stop this, and come back to us!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:14.96,0:13:15.95,Default,H,0,0,0,,Ryouta...
Dialogue: 5,0:13:16.43,0:13:18.09,Default,H,0,0,0,,Ryouta!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:25.40,0:13:27.29,Default,T,0,0,0,,M-My hip...
Dialogue: 5,0:13:27.29,0:13:28.53,Default,S,0,0,0,,Mr. Taira!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:29.06,0:13:30.83,Default,H,0,0,0,,Mr. Taira!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:32.42,0:13:33.62,Italics,T,0,0,0,,They're going to kill me.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:35.59,0:13:38.37,Italics,T,0,0,0,,I only have one left?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:39.30,0:13:42.63,Italics,T,0,0,0,,Before he can kill me... I must kill him!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:43.64,0:13:45.55,Italics,T,0,0,0,,To get back to Yuzuhiko!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:45.55,0:13:47.07,Italics,T,0,0,0,,To get back to Akiko!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:47.07,0:13:48.63,Default,S,0,0,0,,Mr. Taira,
Dialogue: 5,0:13:48.63,0:13:50.65,Default,S,0,0,0,,where are you?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:54.48,0:13:58.81,Default,S,0,0,0,,Mr. Taira, I want to apologize to you.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:59.52,0:14:00.57,Default,S,0,0,0,,I want to...
Dialogue: 5,0:14:01.16,0:14:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to go back with you!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:03.52,0:14:05.33,Default,S,0,0,0,,To go home with you.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:06.16,0:14:08.27,Default,S,0,0,0,,I won't worry you again.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:08.27,0:14:10.32,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'll do things right this time.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:10.32,0:14:14.24,Default,S,0,0,0,,Please, just give me one more chance!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:14.68,0:14:16.67,Default,S,0,0,0,,Please, Mr. Taira.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:16.67,0:14:20.73,Default,S,0,0,0,,Please let me apologize, Mr. Taira.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:21.25,0:14:22.99,Default,S,0,0,0,,Mr. Taira!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:23.68,0:14:28.35,Default,T,0,0,0,,S-Sakamoto, I...
Dialogue: 5,0:14:28.35,0:14:31.17,Default,T,0,0,0,,I... I...
Dialogue: 5,0:14:42.92,0:14:46.11,Default,T,0,0,0,,This is karma, isn't it?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:47.14,0:14:51.11,Default,T,0,0,0,,Punishment for what I did.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:51.70,0:14:55.44,Italics,T,0,0,0,,Sorry, Sakamoto, Himiko.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:55.44,0:14:58.86,Italics,T,0,0,0,,I just wanted to go home.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:58.86,0:15:00.25,Italics,T,0,0,0,,I missed my family.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:01.16,0:15:03.25,Italics,T,0,0,0,,That was all.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:07.06,0:15:09.94,Italics,T,0,0,0,,Yuzuhiko... Akiko...
Dialogue: 5,0:15:09.94,0:15:11.30,Italics,T,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:13.70,0:15:18.31,Italics,T,0,0,0,,Daddy can't take any more pain.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:26.06,0:15:27.69,Default,S,0,0,0,,Mr. Taira?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:35.53,0:15:36.77,Default,S,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:37.66,0:15:39.35,Default,S,0,0,0,,Why did this happen?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:41.09,0:15:43.35,Default,S,0,0,0,,Weren't we going to go home together?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:44.42,0:15:45.81,Default,S,0,0,0,,Stand up.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:46.34,0:15:48.16,Default,S,0,0,0,,Say something!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:48.16,0:15:50.59,Default,S,0,0,0,,Tell me another stupid joke, like you always do!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:50.94,0:15:53.33,Default,S,0,0,0,,Start eating your instant ramen before it's cooked!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:56.14,0:16:01.60,Default,S,0,0,0,,I never got... to apologize to you.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:02.82,0:16:04.14,Default,S,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:04.14,0:16:05.93,Default,S,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:17.54,0:16:21.84,Default,H,0,0,0,,Do you think Mr. Taira planned to betray us the whole time,
Dialogue: 5,0:16:21.84,0:16:23.31,Default,H,0,0,0,,the way Date did?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:23.92,0:16:27.17,Default,S,0,0,0,,No, he wasn't like that.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:27.76,0:16:30.77,Default,S,0,0,0,,He was just a normal person.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:33.74,0:16:38.35,Default,S,0,0,0,,And that's why he got scared and suspicious.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:39.16,0:16:41.01,Default,S,0,0,0,,No one wants to die.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:41.01,0:16:42.31,Default,S,0,0,0,,Everyone wants to go home.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:43.06,0:16:48.93,Default,S,0,0,0,,So, when he got hurt and was alone with despair closing in...
Dialogue: 5,0:16:49.96,0:16:53.57,Default,S,0,0,0,,his heart broke.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:53.57,0:16:54.37,Default,S,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 5,0:16:55.50,0:16:57.63,Default,S,0,0,0,,I basically killed him!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:58.72,0:16:59.57,Default,S,0,0,0,,I...{Her face here is, like, "Man up, faggot." -GBF}
Dialogue: 5,0:17:03.56,0:17:06.49,Default,H,0,0,0,,Do you want to go home, too?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:07.26,0:17:10.83,Default,S,0,0,0,,Yeah, I want out of here,
Dialogue: 5,0:17:10.83,0:17:12.99,Default,S,0,0,0,,away from this hell.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:18.34,0:17:20.60,Default,H,0,0,0,,You can leave, Ryouta.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:21.48,0:17:23.18,Default,S,0,0,0,,I can leave?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:23.50,0:17:24.52,Default,H,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:24.52,0:17:26.49,Default,H,0,0,0,,I took these chips from back there.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:27.38,0:17:28.97,Default,H,0,0,0,,One of them is Mr. Taira's.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:29.70,0:17:32.89,Default,H,0,0,0,,He took the other two without telling us.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:33.44,0:17:37.25,Default,H,0,0,0,,With these and the three we found, it makes six.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:38.13,0:17:39.82,Default,H,0,0,0,,Plus one from me
Dialogue: 5,0:17:40.32,0:17:41.99,Default,H,0,0,0,,and one from you.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:41.99,0:17:45.07,Default,H,0,0,0,,Those are the eight you need to leave the island.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:46.68,0:17:50.01,Default,H,0,0,0,,If one of us dies, one can leave.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:52.74,0:17:55.84,Default,H,0,0,0,,So that's why you should kill me.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:57.56,0:17:58.39,Italics,H,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:58.92,0:17:59.95,Italics,H,0,0,0,,This is the way it should be.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:01.04,0:18:05.06,Italics,H,0,0,0,,I don't have anywhere to go back to.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:05.68,0:18:09.06,Italics,H,0,0,0,,I didn't have a place to belong, but you changed me.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:10.32,0:18:15.07,Italics,H,0,0,0,,I feel like even if we weren't connected in the real world, our hearts were.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:16.30,0:18:18.59,Italics,H,0,0,0,,Although it was in a virtual world,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:18.59,0:18:20.75,Italics,H,0,0,0,,you saved me.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:21.44,0:18:25.97,Italics,H,0,0,0,,You also saved me on this island, \Nall those times when I almost died,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:25.97,0:18:27.91,Italics,H,0,0,0,,and when I almost fell apart.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:28.34,0:18:31.07,Italics,H,0,0,0,,So now I understand.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:32.50,0:18:35.93,Italics,,0,0,0,,You are my hope for survival.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:38.16,0:18:39.13,Default,H,0,0,0,,Ryouta...
Dialogue: 5,0:18:40.76,0:18:42.47,Default,H,0,0,0,,If you can be saved...
Dialogue: 5,0:18:43.30,0:18:44.73,Default,H,0,0,0,,If it means you can live...
Dialogue: 5,0:18:46.26,0:18:48.45,Default,H,0,0,0,,No matter what becomes of me...
Dialogue: 5,0:18:49.34,0:18:50.81,Default,H,0,0,0,,I won't mind.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:50.81,0:18:52.90,Default,S,0,0,0,,D-Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:53.32,0:18:56.77,Default,S,0,0,0,,You think I want to go home \Nso much that I'd sacrifice you?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:57.86,0:18:59.87,Default,S,0,0,0,,Do you think that's the kind of guy I am?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:00.94,0:19:02.09,Default,S,0,0,0,,I won't abandon you!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:02.62,0:19:04.27,Default,S,0,0,0,,I wouldn't ever do that.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:05.24,0:19:08.45,Default,S,0,0,0,,Not in this world or the virtual one!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:11.24,0:19:14.63,Default,S,0,0,0,,Himiko, you're my Himiko, aren't you?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:18.18,0:19:19.59,Default,S,0,0,0,,I finally realized it.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:20.38,0:19:21.67,Default,S,0,0,0,,I finally got to see you.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:22.86,0:19:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Himiko...
Dialogue: 5,0:19:34.42,0:19:35.35,Default,S,0,0,0,,I always...
Dialogue: 5,0:19:37.16,0:19:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I always wanted to meet you.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:27.44,0:20:28.49,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Himiko?{This would've been so much better if the episode had ended on that pan up to the moon. At least then we could've pretended that Ryouta isn't a dickless faggot.}
Dialogue: 5,0:20:29.96,0:20:31.09,Italics,S,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:32.18,0:20:35.29,Italics,S,0,0,0,,She's still scared.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:38.34,0:20:39.87,Italics,S,0,0,0,,She should be scared.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:40.42,0:20:43.03,Italics,,0,0,0,,But for me, she's doing her best not to be.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:43.88,0:20:46.45,Italics,S,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 5,0:20:46.45,0:20:47.89,Default,O,0,0,0,,Not going to do it?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:48.54,0:20:50.41,Default,O,0,0,0,,Remember what I told you?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:50.41,0:20:52.97,Default,O,0,0,0,,The first one to move wins.{Ep.10 10:04}
Dialogue: 5,0:20:52.97,0:20:55.03,Default,O,0,0,0,,Show her what a man you are.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:55.03,0:20:57.98,Default,O,0,0,0,,Or are you still satisfied with holding yourself back?{References ep.10 9:56}
Dialogue: 5,0:20:57.98,0:20:59.69,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Sh-Shut up!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:01.00,0:21:03.86,Default,O,0,0,0,,You'll never catch up to me that way.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:04.34,0:21:05.82,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:05.82,0:21:07.27,Italics,S,0,0,0,,I don't...
Dialogue: 5,0:21:08.28,0:21:09.37,Italics,,0,0,0,,look up to you anymore!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:11.14,0:21:12.86,Italics,S,0,0,0,,I finally understand.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:12.86,0:21:16.21,Italics,S,0,0,0,,What matters is caring for others.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:17.18,0:21:18.89,Italics,S,0,0,0,,If I'd known that...
Dialogue: 5,0:21:19.67,0:21:22.01,Italics,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have let Mr. Taira die.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:22.98,0:21:24.95,Italics,S,0,0,0,,I could've gotten along with my family.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:26.15,0:21:28.85,Italics,S,0,0,0,,I thought I was the only one that mattered.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:29.36,0:21:30.83,Italics,S,0,0,0,,I looked down on others.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:32.10,0:21:37.81,Italics,S,0,0,0,,If I hadn't, I never would've been brought to this island!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:39.86,0:21:40.71,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Oda...
Dialogue: 5,0:21:41.40,0:21:43.01,Italics,S,0,0,0,,I'm not like you.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:44.02,0:21:45.65,Italics,S,0,0,0,,I won't be like you.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:47.14,0:21:49.57,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Stop invading my thoughts!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:04.68,0:22:05.34,Default,H,0,0,0,,Ryouta?
Dialogue: 5,0:22:06.26,0:22:07.45,Default,H,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 5,0:22:08.26,0:22:10.09,Default,S,0,0,0,,Sorry for springing this on you,
Dialogue: 5,0:22:10.76,0:22:14.39,Default,S,0,0,0,,but doing this here, in the heat of the moment...
Dialogue: 5,0:22:15.02,0:22:16.47,Default,S,0,0,0,,It's not right.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:17.86,0:22:21.05,Default,S,0,0,0,,Himiko, let's leave this island together.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:21.84,0:22:23.01,Default,S,0,0,0,,Let's go back together!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:23.73,0:22:24.87,Default,S,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 5,0:22:25.92,0:22:26.91,Default,S,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 5,0:22:27.88,0:22:30.45,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'll start dating you officially.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:32.47,0:22:35.37,ED2 en,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\fsp-7.5}All the way from the farthest ends of the world
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.47,0:22:35.37,ED2 en 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\fsp-7.5\blur3}All the way from the farthest ends of the world
Dialogue: 1,0:22:32.47,0:22:35.37,ED2 ro,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\fsp-7.5}saihate no story idaite
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.47,0:22:35.37,ED2 ro 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\fsp-7.5\blur3}saihate no story idaite
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.37,0:22:39.69,ED2 en,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\fsp-7.5}I have been wandering without a destination
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.37,0:22:39.69,ED2 en 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\fsp-7.5\blur3}I have been wandering without a destination
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.37,0:22:39.69,ED2 ro,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\fsp-7.5}ate mo naku samayoitsuzuketa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.37,0:22:39.69,ED2 ro 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\fsp-7.5\blur3}ate mo naku samayoitsuzuketa
Dialogue: 5,0:22:38.86,0:22:40.14,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:39.69,0:22:42.47,ED2 en,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\fsp-7.5}Now a new world emerges from the haze
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.69,0:22:42.47,ED2 en 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\fsp-7.5\blur3}Now a new world emerges from the haze
Dialogue: 1,0:22:39.69,0:22:42.47,ED2 ro,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\fsp-7.5}nijinda new world
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.69,0:22:42.47,ED2 ro 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\fsp-7.5\blur3}nijinda new world
Dialogue: 5,0:22:40.14,0:22:41.62,Italics,S,0,0,0,,This is what's right.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:41.62,0:22:47.33,Italics,S,0,0,0,,I {\i0}will{\i1} escape this hell... together with Himiko.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:42.47,0:22:44.83,ED2 ro,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\fsp-7.5}The game has only just begun
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.47,0:22:44.83,ED2 ro 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\fsp-7.5\blur3}The game has only just begun
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.15,0:22:48.20,ED2 en,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\fsp-7.5}The beginning of the end is in my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.15,0:22:48.20,ED2 en 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\fsp-7.5\blur3}The beginning of the end is in my eyes
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.15,0:22:48.20,ED2 ro,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\fsp-7.5}ima hajimari no eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.15,0:22:48.20,ED2 ro 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\fsp-7.5\blur3}ima hajimari no eyes
Dialogue: 1,0:22:48.20,0:22:50.70,ED2 ro,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\fsp-7.5}This is where tomorrow brings a new game
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.20,0:22:50.70,ED2 ro 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\fsp-7.5\blur3}This is where tomorrow brings a new game
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.70,0:22:52.64,ED2 ro,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\fsp-7.5}It's time to learn that pain is gain
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.70,0:22:52.64,ED2 ro 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\fsp-7.5\blur3}It's time to learn that pain is gain
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.69,0:22:53.64,ED2 ro,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\fsp-7.5}Ready fight
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.69,0:22:53.64,ED2 ro 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\fsp-7.5\blur3}Ready fight
Dialogue: 5,0:22:53.46,0:22:54.79,Default,HatGuy,0,0,0,,24 hours...
Dialogue: 5,0:22:54.79,0:22:58.37,Default,HatGuy,0,0,0,,Get things back online in 24 hours!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:58.80,0:23:00.99,Default,HatGuy,0,0,0,,Once you get to the island, begin at once.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:00.99,0:23:02.03,Default,HatGuy,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 5,0:23:02.03,0:23:03.09,Default,Dude,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:03.09,0:23:03.88,Default,Dude,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.55,0:23:06.50,ED2 en,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\fsp-7.5}To squash my past despair
